(ned -- A/C ZERO ITERATION, operator spec 2026-08-03.)
(A and C are coupled: the A measurement assumes C, and the C measurement)
(assumes A. So neither converges on its own -- run them alternately and let)
(the pair settle. Operator spec: 5 iterations of "given C calibrate A, given)
(A calibrate C".)

(Each inner cycle applies its own rotation and ABORTS LOUDLY if its delta got)
(worse, so a bad sign stops the loop instead of walking the head away.)
(This routine writes NO zeros -- it leaves the head sitting at the corrected)
(pose, and the accumulated correction IS the offset. RECORD TO PARAMS is a)
(separate, explicit press.)

(Requires C to have been taught once - press SET C REF twice before StartAC.)

(Results: #3062 = A dY first before, #3063 = A dY last after)
(          #3064 = C dX first before, #3065 = C dX last after)
(          #3066 = total A correction deg, #3067 = total C correction deg)
(          #3068 = iterations completed)

o<cal_ac_iterate> sub
  #<cx>  = #1
  #<cy>  = #2
  #<top> = #3

  #<n> = 5             (operator spec: 5 iterations)

  o5 if [#<_metric> EQ 0]
    (abort, CAL AC: switch to MM first)
  o5 endif
  o6 if [#<top> EQ 0 AND #<cx> EQ 0 AND #<cy> EQ 0]
    (abort, CAL AC: no puck centre - run StartPuck first)
  o6 endif
  o7 if [#3058 EQ 0]
    (abort, CAL AC: C has never been taught. Press SET C REF to tilt A to -45, jog the tip into place, press SET C REF again - then StartAC runs unattended.)
  o7 endif

  #3066 = 0
  #3067 = 0
  #3068 = 0

  #<i> = 1
  o100 while [#<i> LE #<n>]
    (PRINT, CAL AC: ---- iteration #<i> of #<n> ----)

    (--- A, taking C as given ---)
    o<cal_a_zero> call [#<cx>] [#<cy>] [#<top>]
    o110 if [#<i> EQ 1]
      #3062 = #3050
    o110 endif
    #3063 = #3051
    #3066 = [#3066 + #3052]

    (--- C, taking the A we just set as given ---)
    o<cal_c_zero> call [#<cx>] [#<cy>] [#<top>]
    o120 if [#<i> EQ 1]
      #3064 = #3055
    o120 endif
    #3065 = #3056
    #3067 = [#3067 + #3057]

    #3068 = #<i>
    (PRINT, CAL AC iteration #<i>: A dY #3051 mm, C dX #3056 mm, running A #3066 deg, C #3067 deg)

    #<i> = [#<i> + 1]
  o100 endwhile

  (--- park at the puck centre, tip clear ---------------------------------)
  G90
  G1 Z[#<top> + 5.0] F500
  G1 A#3069 C#3070 F600
  G1 X#<cx> Y#<cy> F500
  G1 Z[#<top> + 5.0] F500
  M65 P3
  M50 P1

  (PRINT, CAL AC DONE: A dY #3062 -> #3063 mm, C dX #3064 -> #3065 mm over #3068 iterations. Total A #3066 deg, C #3067 deg. If the deltas improved, press RECORD TO PARAMS.)
  (DEBUG, CAL AC: A dY #3062 to #3063, C dX #3064 to #3065, A corr #3066, C corr #3067)

o<cal_ac_iterate> endsub

M2 (end program)
